they cannot edit Mesh terms obviously, but

00:18:02.289 --> 00:18:07.340
if the publisher were to write back and say
I cannot do that, we can certainly do that

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.340
for you.

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:14.630
There are a couple of general My NCBI questions.
